SUMMARY:One Piece: 4th Anniversary OP17  Pre-Release
DESCRIPTION:🏴‍☠️ Celebrate four years of the One Piece Card Game with CCS Houston at the OP-17 4th Anniversary Pre-Release Event! Hosted by Luffy’s Corner\nBe among the first players to crack open the newest set\, build your deck on the spot\, and battle fellow pirates for exclusive pre-release prizes. Whether you’re chasing new leaders\, testing fresh strategies\, or just excited to experience the set before official release\, this is the perfect chance to jump in with the community. \nThis event is capped at 32 players\, so reserve your spot before it fills! \n  \n🗓️ Date: August 21\, 2026 \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \n📝 Event Overview:\n\nFormat: Standard\nTournament Structure: Sealed\nExpected Number of Rounds: 3\nPlayer Capacity: 32\nEntry Fee: $40\nSign Up: On-Site\nPlayers get 6 packs to build their decks\n\n  \n💰 Prize Pool:\n\n1st Place: Store Tournament Winner Pack\nParticipation: Participation Pack\nYou get to keep what you pull from the packs you open!\n\nBandai participation + winner pack \n  \n📋 Registration Details:\n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration starts: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/one-piece-4th-anniversary-op17-pre-release/
CATEGORIES:Trading Card Game
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-One-Piece-4th-Anniversary-OP17-PRe-Release-Event.png
END:VEVENT
