SUMMARY:Pokemon Mini Con
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon Mini Con – Pick Your Starter\, Start Your Adventure\nAsk ten Pokémon fans how they got started and you’ll hear ten different answers. It might have been opening a Game Boy for the first time. Or racing home to watch the anime after school. Maybe it was pulling a favorite card from a pack and carrying it everywhere for months. Pokémon Mini Con is all about those moments! \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 August 22\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking  \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🛍️ Pokémon Marketplace\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe marketplace floor at Pokémon Mini Con feels a lot like stepping into the tall grass on Route 1. Every booth brings a new encounter\, with cards to chase\, collectibles to discover\, and hidden gems waiting to be found. You never know when you’ll run into the piece that completes your collection or the find you didn’t know you needed. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🦹‍♂️ Pokémon Cosplay Showcase | 3PM -4PM\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSuit up\, Trainers! Transform into your favorite Pokémon characters or Gym Leaders and show off your moves in our cosplay showcase. ✨ Hosted by @ShinpaiBunny ✨ Check in by 2:30PM\, the showcase kicks off at 3PM sharp. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🎨 Pokémon Face Painting and Hair Braids – Both Days\nChoose your favorite Pokémon\, show off your team spirit\, and add a little extra magic to your day with face painting starting at $6 and braids ranging from $3-20 (based on complexity) ✨ Hosted by @voilslinda and @will.and.whimsy \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🖼️ Pokémon Community Canvas- Both Days\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAdd your artistic inspiration to our one-of-a-kind Pokemon Community Canvas! Draw your favorite Pokémon\, sketch a Poké Ball in your own style or add an inspired message to fellow fans. No professional experience required\, all artists welcome! Make your mark and create something beautiful together as a fandom. \n  \n⚡ Be a Vendor \nNew encounter unlocked: Pokémon Mini Con vendor applications are open! If you specialize in cards\, collectibles\, artwork\, or all things Pokémon\, we want you to be part of the adventure. → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🌊 Calling all Pokémon Fans\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvery great Trainer needs the right team. We’re looking for collaborators ready to join the journey to the Elite Four. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🎤 Workshops & Panels → https://forms.gle/cdpspG6VpUtpaNZ7A\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHave a love for Pokémon and want to be part of the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \nFrom your first starter Pokémon to your latest collection addition\, Pokémon Mini Con celebrates every step of the Trainer journey. 🧢
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/
CATEGORIES:Anime,Trading Card Game
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
END:VEVENT
