SUMMARY:Houston Funko Pop Mart II
DESCRIPTION:Houston Funko Pop Mart II – The Ultimate Funko Marketplace\nHouston Funko Pop Show II is THE place for Funko Pop collectors. Explore vendors specializing in these shelf-worthy collectibles\, featuring vaulted Pops\, Chase variants\, convention exclusives\, signed Funko Pops\, rares\, and the latest releases. Browse anime\, Marvel\, DC\, Disney\, Pokémon\, horror\, sports\, Star Wars\, and more while connecting with fellow collectors who share the hobby. Bring your trade pile\, track down the missing pieces in your collection\, and discover Funko Pops that rarely make it to store shelves. \n  \n📅 Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 – 10AM–6PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟 FREE Entry · FREE Parking \n  \nEvent Highlights\n🔎 A Collector’s Paradise\nLooking for SDCC/NYCC convention exclusives? Flocked variants? Glow-in-the-dark or sticker exclusives? That fandom Funko that sold out before you grabbed one? Our vendors are your best bet. Aisles of Marvel\, DC\, pop culture\, anime\, horror\, gaming\, and sports figures are ready to sell. Come find yours. \n  \n💰Buy\, Sell\, and Trade All Day\nBring your pops to trade\, sell\, or upgrade! Collectors and vendors will be buying\, selling\, and trading all day\, so it’s the perfect opportunity to make a deal and find that elusive figure you’ve been searching for. \n  \n🛍️ Interested in Vending?\nBring your Funko Pop inventory and table with us. https://forms.gle/pUuxtBi5hUHoMaELA \nDon’t let that missing variant get away! Houston Funko Pop Mart II pops off August 23.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-funko-pop-mart-ii/
CATEGORIES:Action Figure & Toy
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Launch-Kit-Houston-Funko-Pop-Mart-II.png
END:VEVENT
