SUMMARY:National Beyblade League
DESCRIPTION:🌀 National Beyblade League: Beyblade X CCS Tournament 🌀\nBladers\, it’s time to step into the stadium. \nThe National Beyblade League is teaming up with CCS Houston for a full day dedicated to Beyblade X. Battle through the tournament\, challenge new rivals in free play\, meet fellow bladers\, and spend the day celebrating one of the fastest-growing competitive hobbies. \n  \n📅 Sunday\, August 30 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n⚡ Event Highlights ⚡\n  \n🏆 National Beyblade League x CCS Tournament | 12PM – 5PM\nBring your strongest combos into the stadium and compete in the official National Beyblade League x CCS Tournament. \nTournament Features: \n\nThe tournament begins with a 64-player group stage\, where bladers battle to earn a spot in the Top 16. Once the field is set\, the competition shifts to a single-elimination bracket\, where every match brings you one step closer to the championship.\nPrize packages for top finishers: More info on prizes coming soon\n\n👉 Sign-ups here: https://nbl.challonge.com/NBLCCS \nThink you’ve built the ultimate combo? It’s time to prove it in the stadium. \n  \n🏟️ Beyblade X Free Play Arena\nThe battles don’t stop when the brackets do. Jump into the Free Play Arena to test new combos\, run casual matches\, practice launches\, and challenge other bladers outside of tournament rounds. \n  \n🎮 More Than Just Beyblade\nExplore even more collectibles throughout the show floor with CCS vendors featuring trading cards\, anime collectibles\, retro games\, toys\, figures\, and more. \nThe stadium is ready. The brackets are set. The only thing missing is your launch. Join the National Beyblade League: Beyblade X CCS Tournament and see what your combo can do. 🌀 LET IT RIP! 🌀
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/national-beyblade-league/
CATEGORIES:Action Figure & Toy,Anime
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Banner.png
END:VEVENT
