SUMMARY:MTG: Reality Fracture Pre Release Event
DESCRIPTION:Magic: The Gathering | Reality Fracture Prerelease\nJoin Ready Steady Games at CCS Houston for the Magic: The Gathering: Reality Fracture Prerelease\, your first opportunity to play with the newest Magic set before its worldwide release. Build a Sealed deck from your Prerelease Pack\, explore Jace’s Echoverse\, and discover reimagined versions of familiar characters as the fate of the Multiverse hangs in the balance. \n  \n🗓️ September 25\, 2026\n📍9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nEvent Overview:\n\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss\nExpected Number of Rounds: 3\nPlayer Capacity: 30\nEntry: $30\nSign Up: On-Site\n\n  \n💰 Prize Pool:\n\nOne Reality Fracture booster pack per match win\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details:\n\nRegistration Opens: 6:00 PM\nTournament Begins: 7:00 PM
