SUMMARY:Sundry Shop Games Double RCQ | Round 2
DESCRIPTION:Sundry Shop Games Double RCQ – Round 2\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin us at Sundry Shop Games for our upcoming Standard Double Regional Championship Qualifier (RCQ)! Battle against the area’s top players for your shot at an invitation to the Regional Championship and exclusive RCQ prizes. Strike out on the 11:00AM event? No sweat\, we’ve got a second RCQ queued up at 3:00PM. If you’re looking for a mid-season spot to get an invite\, we’ve got you covered. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 Date: September 26\, 2026 | Registration Begins at 10AM\n📍 Sundry Shop Games\, 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ 64 Player Capacity 🏆 Competitive REL \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent Overview: \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFormat: Standard\nTournament Structure: Swiss / Cut to Top 8\nExpected Number of Rounds: 5\, Based on Attendance\nDecklists Required!\nEntry: $15\, ON-SITE REGISTRATION\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n💰 Prize Pool:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n1st Place: RQ Invite + Traditional foil Pinnacle Starcage promo card + Non-foil Pinnacle Starcage promo card + Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\nTop 8: Non-foil Pinnacle Starcage promo card + Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\nParticipation: Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\n\n  \n\n\n\n📋 Registration Details:\n\n\n\n\n\nDoors open at 10AM\nEvent #1 Registration Available until 10:55AM\nEvent #1 Starts at 11AM\nEvent #2 registration closes at 2:55PM\nEvent #2 Starts at 3PM
