SUMMARY:Nerd Yard Sale IV
DESCRIPTION:CCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV — Find Your Next Favorite Thing\nYour shelves are full. Your closet has boxes. Your collection has stories. Now it’s time to pass them on. \nCCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV brings fans\, collectors\, and hobbyists together for a weekend of digging through collections\, finding unexpected treasures\, and giving beloved items a new home. \n  \n📅 September 26-27 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🧺 Sell From Your Collection\nGot boxes of collectibles collecting dust? Downsizing your shelf? Ready to make room for something new? Set up a table and turn your extras\, duplicates\, and forgotten favorites into someone else’s next great find. Perfect for collectors\, families\, hobbyists\, and anyone ready to clear some space while connecting with fellow fans. \n👉 Vendor Tables are open: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🔎 Dig Through Thousands of Fan Finds\nThe best finds are usually the ones you weren’t expecting. Explore tables filled with collections from every corner of fandom\, including: \n📚 Comics\, manga & books\n🎮 Retro games & consoles\n🧸 Plushies\, toys & collectibles\n✨ Anime figures & fandom merchandise\n📼 Vintage media & nostalgia finds\n👕 Clothing\, accessories & memorabilia \n  \n🤝 A Community Sale Built By Fans\nNerd Yard Sale is about more than buying and selling. It’s about talking collections\, sharing memories\, and meeting people who love the same things you do. \n  \n🏨 Traveling to Houston?\nMake it a full weekend! Stay close to the event with our special hotel rate for Nerd Yard Sale IV attendees. 👉 Book here \n  \nBring your bags\, bring your curiosity\, and get ready to discover the next favorite piece in your collection at CCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/nerd-yard-sale-iv/
CATEGORIES:Action Figure & Toy,Anime,Comic,Video Game
