SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con XII
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XII – Find It. Trade It. Collect It.\nIf you’ve been sitting on trade bait\, chasing a grail\, or just need to restock staples before the next format shift\, this is your weekend. Houston TCG Con XII is three days of curated buying\, selling\, and trading across every major game – the vendors across the table are collectors just like you\, and they’re buying out of your binder while you shop theirs. \n  \n📅 Friday\, October 2 to Sunday\, October 4\, 2026\n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday 10AM – 5PM | Sunday 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 Dozens of Vendor Tables – One Curated Floor\nForget the rows of random tables. Houston TCG Con XII brings together vendors with serious depth across Pokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, Flesh and Blood\, Dragon Ball Super\, Digimon\, and more. Different games\, different collections\, one very busy floor. \n  \n🤝 Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend\nThis is a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping trip. The vendors here are collectors first. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n💼 Interested in Vending?\nIf you’ve got singles\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or anything else the Houston community is hunting this Labor Day weekend\, apply here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nThree days is worth the trip. Book your stay: Here \n  \nYour binder has three days of work ahead of it. Lots of Pokémon\, MTG\, One Piece\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, and more give you plenty to dig through\, trade around\, and bring home at Houston TCG Con XII.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xii/
