SUMMARY:Houston Pop Culture Market I
DESCRIPTION:Houston Pop Culture Market – The Place to Collect Your Fandom.\nBuild your dream collection at Houston Pop Culture Market\, a one-day marketplace for toys\, comics\, anime collectibles\, gaming memorabilia\, artwork\, figures\, and pop culture collectibles. Explore a full floor of trusted vendors bringing fan-favorite finds\, rare collectibles\, vintage treasures\, and unique items from across every fandom. Everything from action figures and anime merchandise to retro gaming\, comic books\, collectibles\, and nostalgic favorites all in one place! \n  \n📅 Sunday\, October 18\, 2026 | 10AM–5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟 FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🛍️ What’s Waiting on the Floor\nFind your fandom essentials at booths stacked with full collections of pop-culture inventory from every fandom. Your era. Your favorite character. The grail that got away. It’s all happening in Houston.  Anime\, retro games\, toys\, action figures\, DVDs\, TCG\, Funkos\, and more. \n  \n🤝 Shop\, Trade\, and Connect\nConnect with vendors as into pop culture as you are. Make trades and have a great conversation at the tables about the genres you both love and the rare items you’re searching for. \n  \n💼 Tables Available\nGet in on the ground floor. Literally. Bring your pop culture collection and join us as a vendor for Houston Pop Culture Market I. \n👉 Apply here \nOne floor. Everything you’re into. Houston Pop Culture Market I launches Sunday\, October 18.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-pop-culture-market-i/
CATEGORIES:Action Figure & Toy,Anime,Comic,Sports Card,Video Game,Wrestling
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Launch-Kit-Houston-Pop-Culture-Market-I.png
