SUMMARY:Houston World of Hot Wheels V
DESCRIPTION:🚗🏁 Houston World of Hot Wheels V | From Redlines to Racecars 🏁🚗\nThe weather is cooling down\, but the diecast hunt is heating up. Thirty thousand cars can make a very long shopping list! \nHouston World of Hot Wheels V brings the diecast community together this October for a massive weekend of Hot Wheels\, Matchbox\, vintage pieces\, customs\, racing\, trading\, and collector discoveries. \n  \n📅 October 24-25 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 EVENT HIGHLIGHTS 🔥\n🛒 Hot Wheels Swap & Shop | Both Days\n50+ vendors. 30\,000+ diecast cars. One serious collector hunt. \nDig through Hot Wheels\, Matchbox\, M2\, Greenlight\, Johnny Lightning\, premium Car Culture\, vintage pieces\, redlines\, MOC collectibles\, loose mainlines\, Super Treasure Hunts\, Treasure Hunts\, and more. \n  \n👶 Mini Zones & Family Fun\nYounger collectors and first-time racers have plenty to explore\, with family-friendly spaces designed to make the weekend fun for every generation of diecast fan. \n  \n🚨 Vendors Wanted\nHave STHs\, vintage redlines\, customs\, premium diecast\, or boxes of mainlines ready to move? Houston World of Hot Wheels V is looking for vendors bringing cars collectors actually want to dig through. \n📥 Apply: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \n  \n🏨 Traveling to Houston?\nSpecial hotel rates are available for attendees traveling in for the weekend. \nBook here 👉🏻 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \nHunt the cars. Race the cars. Trade the cars. Build a collection nobody else has. October is rolling in hot.
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-v/
