UID:102380-1795186800-1795366800@ccs-houston.com
SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con XIII
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XIII – Another Weekend\, Another Hunt\nThe hobby doesn’t slow down for the holidays; it just gets more interesting. Houston TCG Con XIII brings the community together for another big weekend of cards\, collecting\, and trading. Bring your binder\, bring your trades\, and bring that card you’ve been sitting on since summer. You never know who’s been looking for exactly what you’ve got. \n  \n📅 November 20 – 22\, 2026 \n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday & Sunday 10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\nEvery Major TCG on One Houston Floor\nPokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, Dragon Ball Super\, Digimon\, Flesh and Blood – the full lineup\, curated vendor by vendor. Singles\, sealed ETBs\, booster boxes\, and collection boxes. Graded slabs from PSA\, SGC\, CGC\, and BGS. Japanese imports and OCG product. Vintage and WOTC-era Pokémon. Competitive staples for current formats. Starter-friendly product for collectors just getting into their first game. Whatever you’re hunting\, it’s on a table this weekend. \n  \n📁 Bring the Binder – the Vendors Are Buying Too\nThis is a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping trip. The vendors here are collectors first. They’re working buylists\, moving bulk\, and trading out of attendee binders right alongside everyone else. Show up with the specs you’ve been sitting on. Come ready to deal. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, and expert insight all weekend. \n  \n🎴 New to the Hobby? Start Here.\nEvery game represented\, vendors who genuinely enjoy explaining the hobby\, and zero pressure. Houston TCG Con has always been the room where serious collectors and first-timers coexist without either feeling out of place. Bring the friend who’s been curious. Bring the kid who just cracked their first pack. \n  \n🛒 Interested in Vending?\nGuest vendor tables are open. If you’ve got singles\, sealed product\, graded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or anything else the community is hunting this season\, apply here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \nStaying the Weekend?\nThree days is worth the trip. Book your stay: Here \n  \nThe year may be winding down\, but the hobby isn’t. Houston TCG Con XIII is bringing the community together for another big weekend of cards\, collecting\, and trading\, with one floor and every major TCG!
