UID:102369-1795860000-1795971600@ccs-houston.com
SUMMARY:Houston Comic & Toy Exchange I
DESCRIPTION:🧸📚 Houston Comic & Toy Exchange I – Gift What Matters 🧸🎮\nHouston Comic & Toy Exchange I is a collector’s dream and your one-stop shop for fandom gift-giving this season. Find something for the gamers\, vinyl figure collectors\, and manga fans you never know how to shop for. Crawl hard-to-find comics\, rare toys\, collectibles\, anime\, and pop culture to check off your entire December list at local vendors…and get something for yourself too. \n  \n📅 Nov 28-29 | 10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🎁 EVENT HIGHLIGHTS\n🛍️ All-Weekend Houston Comic & Toy Exchange Marketplace\nAnime figures for an otaku’s prize collection. Comics your collector lost in college and wants back in their bins. Toys for kids of all ages\, and pop culture favorites for the TV superfans. This marketplace is everything you need and a lot you want. \n👉 Vendor Tables are open: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🤝 Create and Collaborate With Us\nWant to be a part of what makes our weekends memorable? Have some free time and a booth dream? We need Raleigh creators and collaborators to add the community heart and soul that takes our events to the next fandom level. \nWorkshops\, Panels & Activities →https://forms.gle/KAqqMsUtw4gB23oo9 \nVolunteer → https://forms.gle/QVHT4aJJUGgoUcrd9 \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nEnjoy a special room rate of $79/night at TownePlace Suites\, just about 15 minutes from the venue! \nBook your stay 👉 Here \n  \nGet a head start and make holiday shopping a bonus crawl by bypassing the retail big box shops. Collect the things the fans you love really want and wrap up the year with some festive holiday grails at Houston Comic & Toy Exchange I. 🎁
